00:10:34.034 --> 00:10:36.978
music videos with a narrative through line about a series of deaths connected

00:10:36.994 --> 00:10:38.850
to the band's frontman Spencer Charnas.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:42.586
So kind of similar to Four Flies on the Gray Velvet. Ice Nine Kills also did

00:10:42.608 --> 00:10:46.054
a deluxe version of The Silver Scream, which appropriately contains a song

00:10:46.102 --> 00:10:46.838
about Scream.

